     "demoreel record -o demo.mp4 -d 20 -- kate"),
    ("record until you say stop, then stop it from any terminal",
     "demoreel record -o demo.mp4 -d 0 -n mydemo -- kate &\ndemoreel stop mydemo"),
    ("show the app being used: these steps run while it records",
     "demoreel record -o demo.mp4 -d 20 --cursor \\\n"
